---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { Content, frontmatter as page } from '../content/learn.md';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Page title={page.title} description={page.description}>
  <section class="document wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">{page.eyebrow}</p><h1>{page.title}</h1><div class="prose"><Content /></div>
    <div class="learning-grid">
      <a class="learning-card" href={`${base}/user-guide/`}><img src={`${base}/screenshots/phrase.png`} alt="The phrase editor, explained in the field guide" width="640" height="480" /><div><p class="eyebrow">Follow along</p><h2>Visual field guide ↗</h2><p>Explore the screens, see the controls in action and start making patterns.</p></div></a>
      <a class="learning-card" href={`${base}/manual/`}><img src={`${base}/screenshots/modulation.png`} alt="Modulation controls covered in the manual" width="640" height="480" /><div><p class="eyebrow">Go deeper</p><h2>User manual ↗</h2><p>Find instruments, effect commands, settings and the finer details.</p></div></a>
      <a class="learning-card" href={`${base}/font-generator/`}><img src={`${base}/homepage-screenshots/engine-achchid.png`} alt="ChooChooTracker instrument screen preview for the font generator" width="640" height="480" /><div><p class="eyebrow">Make your own</p><h2>Font generator ↗</h2><p>Convert a TTF or OTF font into a custom bitmap font and preview it in the tracker UI.</p></div></a>
    </div>
    <p>Something still unclear? <a class="text-link" href="https://discord.gg/Ut9vM6zgKU">Come ask on Discord ↗</a></p>
  </section>
</Page>
